    <string name="privacy_body">World TV does not ask you to create an account. Favorites, theme, and the last country you opened are stored only on this device.\n\nThe app downloads channel lists from GitHub (the public Famelack dataset). GitHub can see the network address of that request. When you press play, this device connects directly to the stream operator or, for embedded webcams, to YouTube. Those services receive the usual technical data a player sends, including your IP address. World TV does not run its own analytics or advertising SDK.\n\nSome listings are marked region locked. A stream can also fail because it is offline or uses a format this device cannot play.\n\nClear saved listings in Settings to delete the downloaded catalog. Uninstalling the app removes favorites and settings.\n\nWorld TV is an independent directory. It is not the official Famelack app and it is not operated by the channels, stations, or webcam owners.</string>
